Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 09:50:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] cursor smear: travel across pane and tab switches

The trail state is per pane, in pane-relative coordinates, so switching
the active pane made the cursor appear in place. Keep the last cursor
corners drawn in screen space and start the new pane's smear from them.
Paint the active pane last so its smear isn't covered by the backgrounds
of the panes it crosses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
